// Provenance S1: two INSEE Melodi datasets (data.gouv.fr, organisation
// INSEE) - monthly IPC Ensemble (input of L. 161-25) and 1er quintile hors
// tabac (input of the SMIC relevement, decret 2025-1228 art. 3). Series are
// extracted by corpus/laws/fr/revalorisation/tools/fetch_insee_ipc.py from
// the pinned bytes sources/insee/.cache/*.zip into
// sources/insee/insee-ipc-series.json. Do not edit by hand.
//
// Package window (phase 0): IPC series 1996/2011 -> 2026-08/09, base 2025
// (INSEE republished the history in base 2025 in full - no splice needed;
// the 2015->2025 splice is fixed by the bytes themselves). L. 161-25 text
// pinned from the CSS mirror dump (LEGIARTI000031781092, VIGUEUR from
// 2016-01-01). DSS instructions DSS/2B/2026/46 (revalorisation at
// 2026-04-01) and DSS/2B/2025/177 (resource ceilings at 2026-01-01) pinned
// as official PDF bytes plus extracted layout text (inbox 2026-10-06,
// provenance.json with URL, sha256, date). Rules - next phase, see README.

